{"ref":"character:richter-belmont","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Richter Belmont is a playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Platinum_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:platinum-whip"}," ",{"t":"Platinum Whip","r":"weapon:platinum-whip"},", but he also has the option of starting with the ",{"i":"Sprite-Morning_Star.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:morning-star"}," ",{"t":"Morning Star","r":"weapon:morning-star"}," provided it has been unlocked."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Richter"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_RICHTER"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Richter_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Platinum_Whip.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:platinum-whip"}," ",{"t":"Platinum Whip","r":"weapon:platinum-whip"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Evolve the Guardian's Targe."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Evelyn_Lark.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Bloodlines Bequeathed - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-10%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Richter Belmont can be unlocked by evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Guardian's_Targe.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"weapon:guardian-s-targe"}," ",{"t":"Guardian's Targe","r":"weapon:guardian-s-targe"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Richter Belmont can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Richter Belmont can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"doesnthaveuno\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Richter starts with +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", -10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", and starts with an extra ",{"i":"Sprite-Divine_Bloodline_(IX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["He can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]},{"k":"p","c":["While playing as him in the ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," stage, a unique chamber connected by a staircase appears outside the very top of the Clock Tower. Entering this chamber despawns all enemies on the screen and begins a special cutscene with ",{"i":"Sprite-Vlad_Tepes_Dracula.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," ",{"t":"Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," which serves as the prelude to the final boss battle of the Ode to Castlevania DLC."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Richter_Belmont.png","w":120,"h":117,"c":["Richter Belmont's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Richter_Belmont.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Richter_Belmont_(Melee_Attack).gif","w":120,"h":66,"c":["Melee attack animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Richter_Belmont_-_trailer.png","w":143,"h":150,"c":["Richter Belmont as seen in the ",{"t":"pre-release trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aGAlK-DIeAE"}," of Ode to Castlevania."]},{"i":"Ode_to_Castlevania_short_-_Richter_sheet.jpg","w":200,"h":102,"c":["Official Ode to Castlevania pre-release trailer model sheet."]},{"i":"Poe_talking_to_Richter_Belmont.png","w":200,"h":90,"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Poe_Ratcho.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," ",{"t":"Poe Ratcho","r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," talking to Richter Belmont as seen in the video \"Mamma mia! Richter Belmont - sopravvissuti ai vampiri\"."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Richter Belmont's unlock spell, \"doesnthaveuno\", is a reference to a YouTube video called \"",{"t":"Castlevania: Rondo of Cards","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QcY5XRYlv1w"},"\" by ",{"t":"Genowhirl70","x":"https://www.youtube.com/@Genowhirl70"},", which is based on another YouTube video, \"",{"t":"Dracula & Richter - YOU HAVE UNO!","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gcRTzxQzClk"},"\", by ",{"t":"NovaArby","x":"https://www.youtube.com/@NovaArby"},", which is itself a parody of the \"",{"t":"You Have UNO","x":"https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/you-have-uno"},"\" meme and the ",{"t":"famous dialogue exchange","x":"https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/die-monster-what-is-a-man"}," between Dracula and Richter before their battle in the intro of Symphony of the Night."]},{"c":["Richter Belmont is one of the very few characters in Vampire Survivors who has voice acting, alongside ",{"t":"Vlad Tepes Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," and ",{"t":"Death","r":"character:death-character"},". He is voiced by ",{"t":"SungWon Cho","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SungWon_Cho"},", who is also the voice for Death."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Richter Belmont","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Richter_Belmont"}," in the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}